# PLAN.MD — SPACE INVADERS (AAA RETRO-FUTURISM)

---

## 1. CORE GAMEPLAY MATHEMATICAL MODELING

### Grid System & Movement Logic
```
Grid Dimensions: 5 rows × 11 columns = 55 aliens maximum
Initial Position: x ∈ [-4.5, 4.5], y = 2.0 to -2.0 (world space)
Movement Vector: v = (dx, 0), dx cycles between +0.3 and -0.3 units/frame

Edge Detection Algorithm:
  For each alien in current row:
    if alien.x + alien.width/2 > rightBoundary → reverse direction
    if alien.x - alien.width/2 < leftBoundary → reverse direction
  All aliens move as single unit (synchronized)

Descent Mechanic:
  Upon edge hit: y -= 0.3, flip dx sign
  Descent speed increases exponentially with each row cleared
```

### Alien Drop Patterns (Mathematical Models)
| Pattern | Formula | Trigger Condition |
|---------|---------|-------------------|
| **Random Drop** | `y_drop = rand(-0.5, 0.5)` per alien | 15% chance per frame when moving |
| **Wave Motion** | `y_drop = A·sin(ωt + φ)` | 25% chance (A=0.3, ω=2π/60) |
| **Formation Shift** | `x_offset = (row_index % 2) * 0.1` | Every descent event |

### Projectile Physics
```javascript
// Player bullets: upward only
bullet.velocity = { x: 0, y: +8.0 } // units/frame
bullet.lifetime = 60 frames (auto-cleanup)

// Alien bullets: parabolic arc with player tracking
alienBullet.velocity = { 
  x: sign(player.x - alien.x) * rand(1.5, 2.5),
  y: -rand(4.0, 6.0)
}
alienBullet.acceleration = { x: 0, y: -0.05 } // slight upward curve

// Collision Detection (AABB with padding)
function checkCollision(a, b, padding = 0.15): boolean {
  return a.x - a.w/2 + padding < b.x + b.w/2 - padding &&
         a.x + a.w/2 - padding > b.x - b.w/2 + padding &&
         a.y - a.h/2 + padding < b.y + b.h/2 - padding &&
         a.y + a.h/2 - padding > b.y - b.h/2 + padding;
}
```

### Score & Progression System
| Event | Points | Multiplier |
|-------|--------|------------|
| Row 1 (top) alien killed | 30 | ×1.0 |
| Row 2-3 aliens | 20 | ×1.0 |
| Row 4-5 (bottom) aliens | 10 | ×1.0 |
| Alien bullet hits player | -1 life | N/A |
| Player bullet hits alien | +points | N/A |
| Wave cleared | 1000 base | ×(wave_number) |

**Wave Progression:**
```
Wave N = floor(total_kills / 55) + 1
Alien Speed Base: v_base = 0.3 + (N-1) * 0.08
Max Descent Count: D_max = 20 - min(N, 19)
```

---

